  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, first you concentrate your magicka.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351116
    - rid: 4351268282100351117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351120
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, you need to start "whispering" to the world.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Alteration is about convincing the powers that be that maintaining your
      "reality" would be easier than the current one.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh, wha-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351119
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Focus, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351121
    - rid: 4351268282100351122
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351123
    - rid: 4351268282100351124
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, convince the world that your skin is as hard as wood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351125
    - rid: 4351268282100351126
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori tries to cast the Oakflesh spell that Yuri's been reading up on,
      and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351132
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah crap!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351128
    - rid: 4351268282100351129
    - rid: 4351268282100351133
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: My right arm's made out of wood!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351130
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh dear...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll go get Mr. Tolfdir...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351131
